import source_buffers.dl

to [navigate a UI source pane] {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    set editor to instance's event context as a pointer to UI source editor
    set workspace to editor's workspace
    set tools to workspace's tools
    cancel UI source navigation (the address of (tools's navigation))
    dismiss UI source tools tools
    if instance's event target = editor's back:
        ignore go back in UI source editor editor in (tools's view)
    else:
        require condition (instance's event target = editor's home) reporting "An unregistered source pane action was activated"
        set main to editor's document's project's entry
        set buffer to the UI source buffer for main in editor
        visit UI source document main selecting (buffer's anchor) through (buffer's caret) in editor in (tools's view)
    present UI source pane editor in instance

to [bind UI source panes in] {a pointer to UI source workspace:workspace}:
    set editor to workspace's editors
    loop while editor != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source editor):
        if editor's pane != @intrinsic("construct", UI reference):
            require condition ((editor's back != @intrinsic("construct", UI reference)) and ((editor's home != @intrinsic("construct", UI reference)) and (editor's location != @intrinsic("construct", UI reference)))) reporting "A source pane is missing its declared controls"
            bind (editor's back) in (workspace's instance) to (the function named "navigate a UI source pane $") for event 0 with context (editor as a pointer)
            bind (editor's home) in (workspace's instance) to (the function named "navigate a UI source pane $") for event 0 with context (editor as a pointer)
            present UI source pane editor in (workspace's instance)
        set editor to editor's next
